# Alt-A-Kesh — one of the Genies of the 1997 game, the deck as the original shipped it.
# tier: 6/12 The Genies — 19 life, bribe 80 gold
# enemy: Alt-A-Kesh (1997 in-game name, s30/assets/text/Advstrings.txt @CREATURENAMES)
# designer: Coyote Tex, MicroProse designer/producer — every enemy deck (precon page, ref. 2)
# variant: Original (base game; the enemy deck files are dated 19 September 1996)
# source: ../shandalar-src/Decks.zip:Decks/0426.dck "Alt-A-Kesh (G/U/B, 4th)" [Tier 3 — Manalink
#   3 file dated 2016-02-15; its first 24 maindeck lines are the 1997 deck, the 19 lines (60
#   cards) after them are the modern deck Manalink appended and are NOT shipped; its
#   .vNone/.v<Colour> sections are the 1997 colour-keyed swaps]
# source: ../s30/assets/configs/rogues/alt_a_kesh.toml (main_cards, sideboard_cards, level 6)
#   [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix above]
# source: ../mage-go/rogue_dck/alt_a_kesh.dck [Tier 3 — equals the 1997 prefix]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Enemy_Decks_(Genies) — "Alt-a-Kesh" (Original)
#   [Tier-web — maindeck agrees]
# group: 1997 originals
name: Alt-A-Kesh
